# REST

## Login (admin)
POST http://localhost:9093/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json
{
    "email": "",
    "password": "",
    "rememberMe": true
}

## Login (user)

POST http://localhost:9093/api/auth/local
Content-Type: application/json
{
    "identifier": "",
    "password": ""
}

## Signup
POST http://localhost:9093/api/auth/local/registhr

Content-Type: application/json
{
    "username": "",
    "email": "",
    "password": ""
}

## Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:9093/admin/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": ""
}

## Profile
GET http://localhost:9093/admin/users/me

Authorization: Bearer <Token>
